    "text": "<math><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>363</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></munder><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> <br/><br/>Now we know that<br/><br/> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>∝</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msubsup></math>              ...(i)<br/><br/>where  <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo></math>  reactant pressure<br/><br/> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo></math>  order of reaction<br/><br/>Now rate of reaction is 1.00 torr  <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> , when reactant pressure is  <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>363</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>363</mn><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>344.85</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>,</mo></math>  similarly rate of reaction is 0.5 torr  <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> , when reactant pressure is  <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>363</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>363</mn><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>33</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>243.21</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></math> <br/><br/>Therefore, applying equation (i)<br/><br/> <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0.5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>344.85</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>243.21</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msup></math> <br/><br/> <math><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1.418</mn><msup><mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msup></math> <br/><br/> <math><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1.418</mn></math> <br/><br/>So  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>2</mn></math>"
